AI_PHASE: chromium-process-model

AI_STATUS: correction

OBSERVED: Runtime 35 completed the pre-navigation UI frame but froze near one CPU after the renderer commit while per-tile source/destination peek logging was active.

FIX_REASON: Remove all timing-heavy logging and peekPixels work from SharedImage tile read-lock scope; retain only one bounded root-canvas sample per completed frame.

SCOPE: components/viz/service/display/software_renderer.cc only; AROS-only diagnostic reduction.

VALIDATION: Exact diff restores upstream DrawTileQuad flow and git diff --check passes; coherent -j32 rebuild follows.

AI_DECISION_CHAIN: runtime 35 -> runtime 36
